{"id":"manga","lemma":"manga","pos":"noun","rank":3798,"glosses":["sleeve","set"],"ipa":"/ˈmanɡa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mangas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-manga.wav","examples":[{"text":"Los hombres van en manga corta.","en":"The men are wearing short sleeves.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/352495","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"man","l":"hombre"},{"g":"van"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"cutting"}]},{"text":"Súbete las mangas.","en":"Roll up your sleeves.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454518","words":[{"g":"to go up or come up","l":"subir"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Estas blusas son de manga larga.","en":"These blouses are long sleeved.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645239","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"blouse","l":"blusa"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"long","l":"largo"}]},{"text":"Tengo un as bajo la manga.","en":"I have an ace up my sleeve.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"an ace"},{"g":"short"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Súbete las mangas y ponte a trabajar.","en":"Roll up your sleeves and get to work.","words":[{"g":"to go up or come up","l":"subir"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to work"}]}]}